---
read = ('name', 'qual', 'StrSub', 'StrSub')
call ! TypeError qual() missing 1 required positional argument: 'a'
keyword ! TypeError qual() got an unexpected keyword argument 'z'
too many ! TypeError qual() takes 1 positional argument but 2 were given
twice ! TypeError qual() got multiple values for argument 'a'
repr = <function qual
code ! ValueError name() requires a code object with 0 free vars, not 1
bound = <bound method qual
call ! TypeError odd() missing 1 required positional argument: 'a'
repr = <function odd
generator = ('<generator object gen', 'StrSub')
